# Go source must use LF: gofmt always writes LF, so a CRLF .go file shows up as a
# whole-file diff and fails `make check`. This normalises on checkin/checkout.
*.go text eol=lf

# Shell scripts and the Debian packaging scripts must be LF to run on the target.
*.sh text eol=lf
debian/* text eol=lf

# Everything else is left alone on purpose. In particular the RB-01 web assets are
# CRLF in this repository; do not "fix" them, it turns a two-line change into a
# whole-file diff and buries the review.
